{
  "bookId": "hero-211011",
  "id": "bond-26005",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26005001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "这是什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "送给你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "我代表「异乡人」向你表示感谢，会好好使用这座基地的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不是基地……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是送给蒂娅一个人的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "谢谢。\n这样做，是想要我一直留下来的意思吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "只是希望蒂娅过得舒适一点，\n你这位「异乡之人」，总要有个「归来」的地方。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "「归来」的地方……可以理解为「家」么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是的，可以安心休息的，温暖的家。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "噗……哈哈……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "欸……有什么好笑的吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "很少看到蒂娅这么开心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "……没什么，只是突然想通了一个道理。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "关于「使命」的答案，我已经找到了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "26005016",
              "text": "嗯？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "26005015",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26005016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蒂娅",
          "text": "就是现在，就在眼前，\n站在我面前的，我一直在寻找的，特别的人类。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
